(6777974, 1017275, 141319, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the composition and generally the b&amp;w idea. Also like the way you had the "spot light" on the background. What is a shame is that the detail of the white pearls against the white background gets lost. Still, really cool pic</td>', 'Very nice. I like the composition and generally the b&w idea. Also like the way you had the "spot light" on the background. What is a shame is that the detail of the white pearls against the white background gets lost. Still, really cool pic', '2012-05-25 03:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
