(6777976, 1017237, 141319, '<td valign="top">You probably used this long title so even people like me would "get it" ... Problem with this title is that I would expect to see the "eyes", and IMO, they are not dominant enough, nor is there "hapiness" in them because they are not clear enough and very dark. I am sure others totally disagree with what I have said, I just wanted to let you know why I scored you low.</td>', 'You probably used this long title so even people like me would "get it" ... Problem with this title is that I would expect to see the "eyes", and IMO, they are not dominant enough, nor is there "hapiness" in them because they are not clear enough and very dark. I am sure others totally disagree with what I have said, I just wanted to let you know why I scored you low.', '2012-05-25 03:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
