(6778140, 1017278, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is just terrific.  I can see it as a book jacket cover or even art poster for a futuristic movie.  Very well done and not so much over the top that it looks like nothing but editing.  Way to go.</td>', 'This is just terrific.  I can see it as a book jacket cover or even art poster for a futuristic movie.  Very well done and not so much over the top that it looks like nothing but editing.  Way to go.', '2012-05-25 09:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778142, 1017223, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the simplistic approach.</td>', 'I like the simplistic approach.', '2012-05-25 09:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778144, 1017223, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now. It may not show the ''typical'' idea of superpower by action or manifestation of power, but I LOVE this! The power of imagination and belief comes off strong. It perfectly captures the wonder of the world I child has...something we lose when we become older. This captures the simple pure joy a child has when donning the suit of their imagination. This little boy can and is "Superman" with the power of his imagination. Love it!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. It may not show the ''typical'' idea of superpower by action or manifestation of power, but I LOVE this! The power of imagination and belief comes off strong. It perfectly captures the wonder of the world I child has...something we lose when we become older. This captures the simple pure joy a child has when donning the suit of their imagination. This little boy can and is "Superman" with the power of his imagination. Love it!', '2012-05-25 09:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
