(6778183, 1017157, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Action in the shot is great - the tearing of the shirt, the screaming rage on the face as the inner beast/madness manifests. I like the ''grunge'' texture overlay on the subject for it gives it a gritty feel that plays into the mood/feel pictured here.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Action in the shot is great - the tearing of the shirt, the screaming rage on the face as the inner beast/madness manifests. I like the ''grunge'' texture overlay on the subject for it gives it a gritty feel that plays into the mood/feel pictured here.', '2012-05-25 11:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6778187, 1017292, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Wow, this could be one case of sensory overload for this man:-) The composition makes me think of some of the really weird creatures/beings from the Greek Myths. One thing is for sure there is no way one would be able to sneak up on this Super....unless it is from directly above or below. Processing is seamless and done well to put the head together. My only critique is that I wish the backdrop somehow complemented or played into his supernatural power.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Wow, this could be one case of sensory overload for this man:-) The composition makes me think of some of the really weird creatures/beings from the Greek Myths. One thing is for sure there is no way one would be able to sneak up on this Super....unless it is from directly above or below. Processing is seamless and done well to put the head together. My only critique is that I wish the backdrop somehow complemented or played into his supernatural power.', '2012-05-25 11:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
